  "body": "Slice of #1119 (fixtures family): inputs in the fixture plate / vise / accessory / library dialogs and the fixture, plate and mod-vise rows now carry AccessKit names (`labelled_by` the visible row label; \"Plate to place on\" for the label-less plate picker). New helpers: `form::row_label_id`, `fields::{num_by, num_row, num_plain_row, num_plain_by, named}`. No visible layout or text change; no snapshot PNG touched.\n\nTests: `the_fixture_dialogs_name_every_input`, `the_fixture_rows_name_every_input` (fixture_plate_tests.rs; mutation-checked: removing one name fails the guard). `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` 667 passed; clippy -D warnings clean.\n\nNot exercised: GUI, pixel snapshots, other crates' suites, the ui integration binaries. Remaining for #1119: all other pages (machine editor, wire/sinker, tool editor, setup pages, WCS, thread pages...) and the whole-page guard test; those files are touched by open UI PRs.\n\nChangelog: UI input widgets in the fixture dialogs and rows have accessible names (#1119, slice 1).\nEffort: medium\nRefs #1119\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
